# Laid out Medium on an opened fold's inner screen upright (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2), a finger: the tape
# in each of its states, a second apart (sfdesk frame.mbt): the sidebar in use at first; the page brought over by a
# tap on what shows of it; a chat's side panel opened (it comes over); back (the page over, the panel's edge showing).
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 1000
tapxy -24 420
wait 1000
tap icon:panel-open
wait 1200
back
wait 1000
exit
